  {"i":"ftmyri","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:0px\">","h":"<span class=\"cs-neg-tag\">[청구권자]</span> 청구권자는 <span class=\"cs-red\"><strong>검사에 한정</strong></span> — <span class=\"cs-gbg\">[사법경찰관]</span> <span class=\"cs-x\"><strong>(X)</strong></span>, <span class=\"cs-gbg\">[피고인·피의자·변호인]</span> <span class=\"cs-x\"><strong>(X)</strong></span>","k":"1uskrjy"},
